    {
      "id": "claim_57d73ab863474b86b74a0e6ce4b7b0d0",
      "statement": "The protocol timers are DirectoryConfig fields: domain_token_ttl_s (default 1800 s), domain_verification_ttl_days (default 90) and max_pending_verifications (default 5); Store refuses a new challenge with VERIFICATION_LIMIT_REACHED (429) when the agent already holds that many live pending domain challenges. The network limits (10 s DNS/TLS timeouts, 4 KiB body cap) and the dig dependency are hardcoded in verify.py, not configurable.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/config.py#L45-L49",
