      "id": "claim_7e4d9c268ddc4953911234fd0c79d03d",
      "statement": "domain_verified is a labelled control signal, never KYC or \"verified business\": the trust block built by DirectoryService.build_trust_block carries domain_verification {domain, method, verified_at, expires_at, primary} only when DomainService.primary_verification finds an active verification whose domain covers the endpoint host, and search's domain_verified=true parameter gates inclusion one-sided (false does not exclude) without ranking results.",
