    {
      "id": "claim_ea134992781b43b0b9a372273b1969ed",
      "statement": "The L2 HTTP surface is POST /v1/verify-domain (202), POST /v1/verify-domain/confirm (200) and the public unsigned GET /v1/verify-domain/status?fingerprint which lists active verifications with their primary flags; both POST routes share the per-IP register rate limiter (default 5/hour), and all rejections use the stable codes mapped to fixed HTTP statuses by the add-only errors.py table.",
